<title>FRANCE: Docks de France nine month sales rise.</title>
<headline>Docks de France nine month sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					34,864    vs   34,140</p>
<p>    -- of which third quarter		 11,790    vs   11,731</p>
<p>NOTE - Docks de France said in the BALO official bulletin that sales were up 1.8 percent on a like-for-like and constant exchange rates structure.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
